XML Parser: the event-based xml_parser functions, on libxml2 of the
package az.

The module xml of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/xml.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/xml.
